	"data": "Systems Programming & Low-Level Learning (2025)\n\nWhat It Is\nA sustained period of low-level systems programming study in cithoreal's CS coursework and self-directed learning during Fall 2025. C, C++, assembly, Rust, and OS concepts. This feeds directly into TB's Godot/GDExtension work and future ECS backends.\n\nTimeline of Learning\n\n| Period | Focus |\n|--------|-------|\n| Sep 2025 | Rust fundamentals (introduction, CLI concepts) |\n| Sep–Oct 2025 | C programming (pipes, forks, threads, pthreads)…",
